@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Pengurus / Bendahara" as Pengurus
boundary "Halaman Login\n(/login)" as LoginPage
control "NextAuth Handler\n(/api/auth/[...nextauth])" as AuthHandler
entity "Database\n(Prisma Adapter)" as DB
participant "Google OAuth\nService" as GoogleOAuth

Pengurus -> LoginPage : Akses halaman pengurus (misal: /unggah)
activate LoginPage
LoginPage -> AuthHandler : Cek session token aktif
activate AuthHandler
AuthHandler --> LoginPage : Tidak ada sesi aktif (Unauthenticated)
deactivate AuthHandler

LoginPage -> Pengurus : Tampilkan antarmuka "Masuk dengan Google"
Pengurus -> LoginPage : Klik "Masuk dengan Google"

LoginPage -> AuthHandler : signIn("google", { callbackUrl })
activate AuthHandler
AuthHandler -> GoogleOAuth : Redireksi ke halaman otorisasi Google
deactivate AuthHandler

Pengurus -> GoogleOAuth : Memilih akun & menyetujui izin
activate GoogleOAuth
GoogleOAuth --> AuthHandler : Callback otorisasi (code & profile data)
deactivate GoogleOAuth
activate AuthHandler

AuthHandler -> DB : Cari atau buat record User & Account
activate DB
DB --> AuthHandler : Data User (id, email, name, role)
deactivate DB

AuthHandler -> AuthHandler : Buat JWT / Session Token
AuthHandler --> LoginPage : Sesi berhasil dibuat & redirect ke callbackUrl
deactivate AuthHandler

LoginPage -> Pengurus : Render halaman tujuan dengan akses pengurus
deactivate LoginPage

@enduml
